h her youthful face, warm brown skin, deep brown eyes, wild 4c hair, compact build, linen dress, layered jewelry, braided leather waist cord, and sandals. Werebeast references establish the sleek black werepanther design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/reference/1790359997049-venny-claire-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/alternate/1790360002404-venny-claire-alternate-true-form.png"}','https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/portrait/1790359991558-venny-claire-character-portrait.png',6,1,1,'63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589','a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4',NULL,'bbe46246-e94b-498d-9ab5-cae88e0804f7','2026-09-26T02:37:12.238669+00:00');
